## Interface: 16001
## Title: Nameplates
## Notes: The game's nameplates in Sane UI's dress: a round-cornered health bar with level, threat, name and health inside it, the unit's power and your combo points along its bottom, a border by rank, a red glow on aggro, your debuffs above it, a foe's buffs left and crowd control right of it. Plates of players you do not know are hidden; plates shrink far away.
## Author: Saneroki
## Version: 0.3.0
## Category: Sane UI
## Group: SaneUI
## Dependencies: SaneUI
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\Ability_Hunter_SniperShot
## X-License: MIT

# The module's own table, its words and settings. First: the other files will add to that table.
Nameplates.lua
# The health bar: round at both ends, its border by rank, a ring on your target and focus, the power line, the glow
Bar.lua
# The line inside the bar: quest, raid marker, level, item level, threat, name, health; the bar as wide as the line
Text.lua
# Your debuffs above the bar, a foe's buffs left of it, crowd control right of it, in the game's own aura containers
Auras.lua
# The raid marker, in the line
Marks.lua
# Your combo points on the power line of your target's bar
Resource.lua
# Plates smaller far away: twice close by, their own size at 40 yards, half at 60
Scale.lua
# Our dress on each plate the game shows, laid over its health bar; the game's own bar, name, auras and marks out of sight under it
Plate.lua
